94 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (Muar, also officially declared as Bandar Maharani, is a historic royal town located in the state of Johor, Malaysia. Situated at the mouth of the Muar River, it is celebrated for its well-preserved pre-war architecture, vibrant street art and rich cultural heritage. Muar is widely renowned as a food haven famous for signature dishes such as Mee Bandung, Otak-otak and traditional charcoal-roasted coffee as well as picturesque waterfront spots like Dataran Tanjung Emas. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
